&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; line-height: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; text-align: left"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock>
